{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(orKey:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"If there is no value for the given ","type":"text"},{"code":"key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", returns the description of this key,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"i.e.font family name without the font weight in the end and without whitespaces.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"orKey"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Key"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"key","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The key to use to get a value","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In fact if it seems some rules are missing, or weight are not managed, if the font family only is returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user has an higher probability to use the expected font. Because if a mashup of family name and weight is returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it can produce a PostScript identifier not available, so not usable, so implying a fallback to default system font like "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"San Francisco","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because PostScript identifiers in most of cases do not have whitespaces, remove the